/math-academy-id "q-102669" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & 6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AB=BA={I}_{2}$ is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement $B={A}^{-1}$ is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237920 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eccb9532-7de2-59e7-a82e-6ab5c5c256d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461207} {:answer/id #uuid "a25d5fdd-a31e-51b5-a9cb-b9b85d9e48e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a04379d-5378-57ac-8c8a-5c79d6defc9c" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462357} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a26ee96-ebd3-5ef0-a937-f4248c9f7f8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461209} {:answer/id #uuid "7a779c6b-ec23-5c8c-8565-47792308afae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461210}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186461209} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a3a0ee6-e7ec-58ca-a7bd-fe2195a3acfc" :answer-field/key "$AC=CA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462358} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aeb9f5d1-a68b-53b2-8b45-266c26e51dcc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461211} {:answer/id #uuid "c61e9668-9427-5911-9597-cfb248789995" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461212}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186461212} :answer-field/id #uuid "9af69d4d-34e6-541a-a6e6-dbacb78cccfe" :answer-field/key "$C\\ne {A}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462359} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a333a2c2-f1e6-5df9-b553-c59c8045c3d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667778} {:answer/id #uuid "106febd1-fd05-5f3f-b528-a114e43033d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667779}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186667778} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc80f3f3-4653-5658-9602-4b60e79bde94" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668166}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "67a1c719-c84d-5d17-9d41-c30fb7529952" :question/math-academy-id "q-102670" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AB=BA={I}_{2}$ is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & -3 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AB=BA={I}_{2}$; $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237921 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "caf47f24-5826-503b-9314-2ce4fcb361ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461213} {:answer/id #uuid "66e828c3-1224-5037-bfe0-efa2537a90f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461214}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186461213} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b58693c-bbc8-5575-a394-e3f95bcc8188" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462360} {:answer-field/choices [{: