ments are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AB=BA={I}_{2}$ is true. As a result, $B={A}^{-1}$ and statement $B={A}^{-1}$ is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & -5 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AB=BA={I}_{2}$; $B={A}^{-1}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237923 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec1398e5-e972-59d8-bca4-9aeed1536330" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461225} {:answer/id #uuid "a135e004-34a6-5207-9ef4-ec52ff84fde2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461226}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186461225} :answer-field/id #uuid "6dcf6a9c-0fbc-5e47-87a2-e4afc24a5b1a" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462366} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b601a2db-1f2a-565f-92ec-73d330d6a3d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461227} {:answer/id #uuid "983da061-0c35-5c1c-b8d4-d3f6f57bf0